INSERT INTO lessons (id,course_id,module_id,title,kind,body,minutes,published,sort) VALUES ('product-school-l3','product-school','product-school-m2','NPS Tier-I vs Tier-II Strategic Comparison','note','# NPS Tier-I vs Tier-II Strategic Comparison

*About 25 min*

## Overview
A deep dive into PFRDA regulations, corporate co-contribution benefits under Section 80CCD(2), and the extra ₹50,000 tax deduction under 80CCD(1B) beyond the ₹1.5L Section 80C limit.

## Key features
- Exclusive ₹50,000 tax deduction saving up to ₹15,600 annually in the 30% tax bracket
- Low expense ratio (~0.03% to 0.09%), the cheapest pension fund management in the world
- Active Choice: up to 75% equity allocation (Asset Class E) for aggressive long-term compounding
- Seamless digital onboarding via FundsIndia POP (Point of Presence) gateway

## Who it suits
All salaried and self-employed tax-paying Indian citizens aged 18 to 70.

## Our advantage
Instant digital PRAN generation, automated annual contribution reminders, and expert PFM (Pension Fund Manager) performance tracking.

## How to pitch it
NPS is the most tax-efficient retirement vehicle in India. You get an exclusive ₹50,000 tax deduction that no other product provides, managed at a near-zero fund management fee of less than 0.09%.

## Client FAQs
**Q: What is the exit taxation at age 60?**

60% of the accumulated corpus is 100% tax-free lump sum withdrawal. The remaining 40% is deployed in a life annuity.',25,1,3) ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET course_id=excluded.course_id,module_id=excluded.module_id,title=excluded.title,kind=excluded.kind,body=excluded.body,minutes=excluded.minutes,published=excluded.published,sort=excluded.sort;
