INSERT INTO lessons (id,course_id,module_id,title,kind,body,minutes,published,sort) VALUES ('customer-support-l0','customer-support','customer-support-m0','CKYC Modification & Name Mismatch Resolution','note','# CKYC Modification & Name Mismatch Resolution

**Category:** KYC & Compliance - **SLA:** 24 hours

## When this applies
Client KYC status rejected by KRA (NDML / CVL / CAMS / Karvy) due to PAN-Aadhaar name difference or expired address proof.

## Common root causes
- Discrepancy in middle name or initials between Income Tax Department PAN registry and UIDAI Aadhaar database
- Blurry or cropped PDF/JPEG upload of official identity documentation
- Signature mismatch against bank account cheque leaf or PAN signature
- Incomplete Video In-Person Verification (IPV) recording with insufficient lighting or missing OTP readout

## Resolution steps
1. Check internal KRA sync status on FundsIndia CRM to identify the exact KRA rejection code (e.g., CVL-ERR-104: Name Mismatch).
1. Reach out to client via WhatsApp and registered email with the exact pre-filled CKYC Annexure form.
1. Guide client to complete digital IPV on FundsIndia mobile web portal with camera permissions enabled.
1. Verify uploaded identity documents meet SEBI 300 DPI resolution requirements.
1. Dispatch certified bundle via KRA API bridge and flag for express verification.

## Client message template
> Dear [Client Name], your FundsIndia account setup is nearly complete! Our compliance team noticed a slight spelling difference between your PAN record and Aadhaar identity card. To protect your investments under SEBI guidelines, please click this secure one-touch verification link [Link] to upload a clear photograph of your Aadhaar card and complete a 10-second video check. Our priority desk will clear your KYC within 4 business hours.

## Escalation matrix
| Level | Contact | Timeframe |
|---|---|---|
| L1 Operations Desk | kyc-desk@learninghub.support | 2 to 4 hours |
| L2 Compliance Officer | compliance@learninghub.support | 12 hours |
| L3 Principal Officer | po-escalations@learninghub.support | 24 hours |',8,1,0) ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET course_id=excluded.course_id,module_id=excluded.module_id,title=excluded.title,kind=excluded.kind,body=excluded.body,minutes=excluded.minutes,published=excluded.published,sort=excluded.sort;
