INSERT INTO lessons (id,course_id,module_id,title,kind,body,minutes,published,sort) VALUES ('customer-support-l3','customer-support','customer-support-m3','Annual Capital Gains Statement & Tax Loss Harvesting Extraction','note','# Annual Capital Gains Statement & Tax Loss Harvesting Extraction

**Category:** Tax & Capital Gains - **SLA:** 6 hours

## When this applies
Client requests consolidated capital gains tax report (LTCG / STCG under Section 112A / 111A) for ITR-2 / ITR-3 filing.

## Common root causes
- Client held external mutual fund folios not yet imported into FundsIndia consolidated CAS view
- Grandfathering calculation clarification needed for units acquired prior to January 31, 2018
- Dividend distribution tax / TDS credit reconciliation against AIS (Annual Information Statement) / Form 26AS

## Resolution steps
1. Open Client Portfolio Tax Analytics console on FundsIndia platform.
1. Generate Consolidated Capital Gains Statement for Financial Year with grandfathered NAV benchmarks.
1. Verify all external CAS folios are mapped to client PAN.
1. Export standardized Excel and PDF reports pre-formatted for direct import into ClearTax or CA tax software.
1. Send direct download link with executive summary of STCG, LTCG, and available ₹1.25 Lakh exemption limit.

## Client message template
> Dear [Client Name], your Consolidated Capital Gains Tax Report for FY 2025-26 is ready! Under the latest Finance Act provisions, your net LTCG is ₹[Amount] and STCG is ₹[Amount]. You can download the ITR-ready report with complete grandfathering calculations here: [Report Link].

## Escalation matrix
| Level | Contact | Timeframe |
|---|---|---|
| L1 Tax Support Desk | tax-help@learninghub.support | 2 hours |
| L2 Financial Analyst | wealth-tax@learninghub.support | 4 hours |
| L3 Head of Research | research-head@learninghub.support | 6 hours |',8,1,3) ON CONFLICT(id) DO UPDATE SET course_id=excluded.course_id,module_id=excluded.module_id,title=excluded.title,kind=excluded.kind,body=excluded.body,minutes=excluded.minutes,published=excluded.published,sort=excluded.sort;
